      `header.navs { background-color:#fff }` on the container â€” uncovered by the id
      rule (gutters, logo row, collapsed state), it would render white in dark mode.

   2. Breakpoint. generalstyles.css scopes the desktop `#main-nav` background and the
      menu link text/background rules to `@media (min-width:992px)`, and paints the
      MOBILE hamburger sheet (`#main-nav` collapsed) + its links from the `*_MOBILE`
