   (account/includes/signup_socialaccount_providers.html) renders the provider buttons
   with no <h4> at all, so it has nothing to fix.

   Deliberately NOT touched: the `#e5e5e5` hairline on `h4::before`. A light-grey rule
   on the dark panel is high contrast, not low â€” it reads correctly as-is. */
[data-theme="dark"] .signup #auth-providers h4 span:where(:not(.page-builder-content *, .rsvp-ticket-modal *)) {
