/* Mezzanine Forms pages (DIS-3749) â€” e.g. the "Become a Group Leader" application
   (theme/templates/pages/form.html). `.mezzanine-form-container` hardcodes
   `background:#fff` + `border:1px solid #ccc` in global.less; that is compile-time LESS
